  "notes": "{結|むす}ぶ is a transitive godan verb meaning \"to tie\" or \"to form/conclude.\"\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nCONCRETE USES:\n- ⟦{靴|くつ}→靴：00725_kutsu⟧⟦ひも→紐：02251_himo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to tie shoelaces\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to tie one's hair\n- ⟦リボン→リボン：11256_ribon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to tie a ribbon\n\nABSTRACT USES:\n- ⟦{契約|けいやく}→契約：02698_keiyaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to conclude a contract\n- ⟦{友情|ゆうじょう}→友情：03648_yuujou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to form a friendship\n- ⟦{条約|じょうやく}→条約：04912_jouyaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to sign a treaty\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{実|み}→実：03741_mi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{結|むす}ぶ: to bear fruit (efforts come to fruition)",
